    "headline": "L3Harris (LHX) Lands Seven Year Missile Propulsion Deals For PAC 3 And THAAD",
    "summary": "L3Harris Technologies (NYSE:LHX) has signed multi year propulsion agreements with the Department of War and Lockheed Martin. The contracts cover missile propulsion production for the PAC 3 MSE and THAAD defense systems. The agreements are described as transformative and are intended to nearly triple and quadruple propulsion output for these programs. L3Harris Technologies sits at the center of key U.S. missile defense programs as a propulsion supplier for PAC 3 MSE and THAAD systems. For...",
